<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi security forces are moving to Jurf al-Sakhr and Jurf al-Nasr, deploying reinforcements and preparing a senior meeting on oil-smuggling investigations, while security chiefs press the crackdown and the prime minister’s special force and energy police target pipelines. Kataib Hezbollah rejects the oil probe findings, accuses the prime minister of yielding to US and Gulf pressure, and faces an end-of-week deadline to vacate the area, with al-Zaidi threatening force to assert control. Bahrain has accused Iran of attacking its territory in retaliation for US actions, linking regional tensions to the Iraqi smuggling crackdown. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hollywood Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPdHNNczNoNnZuUk1pXzFmQ2xMdWdDODdMTEVLNE41OXBFcDFSVkVSOGxCSDRtc0d5RnJjeFNCd2h3c0dBOGNmVDdnSXJaX3NiZDd6ejBob2F0NzQ5VzF5ajlqc0UwcGxsV2FEaFhBbUFmbUJjVnpVaXZLV3hZSjRia0hqNmliejZOQnhwMjlUaF8yNjFwLV9DWmExRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amwaj.media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE92NkhqdEJiaEVwYUVibW5UVG1TYUQ1ZFVpS19qd2NqQUZldmt6cEV5eTc5Z2FybW1IQ2hMMGdWV21ibUNxYTRYUlN3X2NWdEtJQkJSMHJEQklyck05?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxOclpCVTJ5ZThCbGlsOF81TmNSTmZRTlh6LVcyT2JndjVWX1gwQW1lMHNDbVRnazVDYlZsSWlWdUFMcFY4OG5TbTlQaERXQ2xmYmFBNlN5VUlzTEg5VXhKdUtNLUlod0VrQ1JOeWRfLUlXVTZtc3IzNmtPT25yY1FoSmM2aWc2VzdqdGVjS3E1TmNyZzF2Y0RSM1FFYy16a01nbnFENGttbm01c1dCR2FRUlBzMU